WEBVTT

00:01:32.360 --> 00:01:35.320
After Takao and the team
defeated the Saint Shields,

00:01:35.320 --> 00:01:39.130
Another Blader with a Sacred
Beast from the tablet appeared.

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:46.500
We were able to make
it out thanks to Zeo's help,

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:50.210
and were able to protect
our Sacred Beasts.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:55.660
Now, the curtain has opened
on the world championships!

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:14.790
It's starting!

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:18.550
This year's world championships
have finally begun!

00:02:18.550 --> 00:02:20.780
I love this uplifting mood!

00:02:20.780 --> 00:02:25.250
This is the same tournament
the four of us won last year.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.370
Good luck this year, too!

00:02:28.790 --> 00:02:30.900
You've all made it!

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.660
Old man Daitenji!

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:37.080
As last year's champions, you all
should have a by in the tournament.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.950
So you shouldn't need
to play in the qualifiers...

00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:41.910
We're not here
for our match.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:45.190
We came to
cheer on Zeo!

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:46.460
Zeo?

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:48.690
I see!

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:54.320
Look at 'em go!

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:56.340
Look! Over there!

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:57.840
There he is!

00:02:57.840 --> 00:02:59.570
Zeo's team should
be up against...

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:03.790
Toru's won,
so if Zeo wins...

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:06.820
That means he
wins the first round!

00:03:06.820 --> 00:03:08.480
--Go for it, Zeo!
--Go for it, Zeo!

00:03:08.480 --> 00:03:09.870
Go, Shoot!

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.370
I won't lose!

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.440
The C block of the qualifiers
is on its last match!

00:03:15.440 --> 00:03:19.010
Who's going to win
this heated battle?

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:22.050
That's it! Go!

00:03:22.050 --> 00:03:22.740
Don't lose!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.600
Takao, calm down!
You're too loud!

00:03:27.170 --> 00:03:28.700
Takao!

00:03:28.700 --> 00:03:31.810
Zeo! Eyes front!

00:03:40.720 --> 00:03:45.580
Whoa! Ganta takes advantage of
Zeo's distraction and counterattacks!

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:51.290
The Genta-Ganta brothers pair have
a chance to make a comeback!

00:03:51.790 --> 00:03:52.940
Pair?

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:56.540
This year's tournament will
be held in tag matches.

00:03:56.540 --> 00:03:59.410
Two people form a pair
and fight together.

00:03:59.410 --> 00:04:03.410
Qualifiers are being held
all around the world.

00:04:03.410 --> 00:04:08.420
And the finals will be held here
in Japan with the top eight pairs.

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:11.700
And that will decide who gets
the glory of being champion.

00:04:12.670 --> 00:04:14.130
Really?

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.950
I explained all
that earlier!

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:18.660
Really? You did?

00:04:18.660 --> 00:04:21.310
So you weren't
listening at all.

00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:24.480
I'm surprised you even
became world champion.

00:04:24.480 --> 00:04:26.040
Shut up!

00:04:27.010 --> 00:04:32.550
Think carefully about who you
decide to pair up with whom.

00:04:33.520 --> 00:04:35.680
What's Zeo doing?

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:39.940
He's not gonna make it
past the qualifiers like this!

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:46.980
Zeo! We'll always
have your back!

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.710
So keep it together!

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:54.180
Takao and the team will
always have my back.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.970
I am not alone!

00:04:59.540 --> 00:05:01.680
Don't lose, Zeronix!

00:05:01.680 --> 00:05:03.840
Blow him back!

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.760
He did it!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:25.130
Zeo turned it
around for the win!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:26.900
With an instant turnaround,

00:05:26.900 --> 00:05:31.420
the Zeo/Toru pair earn their
ticket to the second round!

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:33.600
Good for you, Zeo!

00:05:35.250 --> 00:05:36.600
You did it, Zeo!

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:37.600
Congratulations!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:39.610
Takao! Guys!

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:42.020
You passed the first hurdle.

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.370
Thanks.

00:05:43.370 --> 00:05:47.310
I don't know if I could have
done it without your support.

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:50.520
It was all skill! All skill!

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:54.360
You've gotten stronger, Zeo!

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:59.000
You could even make it into
the big leagues at this rate!

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:03.450
Seeing you work so hard
has gotten me pumped!

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:04.550
Really?

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:09.230
Lately we've only been battling
people after our four Sacred Beasts.

00:06:09.230 --> 00:06:14.210
But for the first time in a while,
we can just focus on winning or losing!

00:06:14.210 --> 00:06:17.960
Just thinking about
that gets me excited!

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:20.740
I can just have
a pure Beybattle!

00:06:20.740 --> 00:06:23.620
Zeo, just work hard
and have fun!

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:26.160
And meet me in
the final rounds!

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:27.220
Yeah!

00:06:27.840 --> 00:06:29.620
--'Kay!
--I'm gonna do my best!

00:06:29.620 --> 00:06:32.560
That's the spirit!

00:06:35.180 --> 00:06:36.290
Enter.

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:38.850
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.010
Thanks.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:03.040
Doctor...

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:06.000
She hid this
from me all along...

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:10.080
Where's the Doctor?
Where the hell is she?

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:18.360
The latent Sacred Beast index has
broken the previous record by 200 times!

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:20.050
It's still increasing!

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:21.100
Doctor!

00:07:22.150 --> 00:07:24.030
I finally found it!

00:07:24.030 --> 00:07:27.550
The strongest Sacred Beast
in the stone tablet!

00:07:27.980 --> 00:07:30.350
If we succeed in
converting it into a Chip,

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.190
The ultimate Bey
will be completed.

00:07:32.190 --> 00:07:35.590
The four Sacred
Beasts will be ours!

00:07:35.590 --> 00:07:36.700
Doctor!

00:07:38.510 --> 00:07:41.260
Doctor, stop the experiment!

00:07:41.260 --> 00:07:44.740
What? I don't remember giving
you the power to tell me that!

00:07:44.740 --> 00:07:47.070
What's going on
here, I wonder?

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:49.280
Doctor?

00:07:49.280 --> 00:07:50.660
Doctor Zagart!

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:51.820
Stop!

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:53.110
Stop it now!

00:07:57.090 --> 00:08:00.510
Output from the
tablet is decreasing!

00:08:00.850 --> 00:08:02.800
All power has been cut!

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:06.310
I didn't expect you
to show up personally.

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:07.700
What brings you here?

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.590
You should know why.

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:15.620
You will leave your equipment
here and exit the premises at once!

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.140
What do you mean?

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:23.250
I know what kind of rogue experiments
you've been running behind my back.

00:08:23.250 --> 00:08:26.000
Think about it, and
it should be clear.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:28.570
Or am I wrong, Doctor?

00:08:28.570 --> 00:08:33.700
You were the one who ordered us research
how to extract Sacred Beasts from the tablet.

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.160
I thought I told
you to wait and see.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:40.740
You went behind my back to extract dozens
of Sacred Beasts and attack the BBA team.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:43.500
And to fail, every single time!

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:50.190
We proposed the idea of an all out attack
using the tablet's Sacred Beast plenty of times.

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:50.880
And yet--

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.260
Enough of this!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:55.810
Get out of here, now!

00:08:56.030 --> 00:08:57.810
Right this instant!

00:08:57.810 --> 00:09:03.350
Listen up! I will directly take charge of
all experiments related to the tablet!

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:04.200
Got it?

00:09:04.200 --> 00:09:04.980
--Yes, sir!

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.280
Good.

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:11.240
I'm home!

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:14.200
Bill? Where are you? Bill!

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.530
Welcome home, Master.

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:18.210
Get this, Bill! I made
it past the prelims!

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:20.210
On my first try, too!

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.130
Well done, sir.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:25.920
It's time for your
violin practice!

00:09:26.700 --> 00:09:29.140
That's not the point!

00:09:29.140 --> 00:09:31.170
It was awesome!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:33.880
Zeronix went after the
other guy's Bey like--

00:09:33.880 --> 00:09:35.380
Master Zeo!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.670
Fine, I'll be right there...

00:09:54.330 --> 00:10:00.880
Dad!

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:05.610
Welcome back, dad!

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:14.880
Dad, I passed the first round of
prelims in the world championships!

00:10:14.880 --> 00:10:16.510
Isn't that the coolest?

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:17.810
Master Zeo...

00:10:17.810 --> 00:10:22.290
Remember that you promised not to
talk about those tops in front of your father.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:23.690
Just this once!

00:10:23.690 --> 00:10:26.330
It's not often something happens
that makes me this happy!

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:27.380
Yes, but...

00:10:27.380 --> 00:10:32.310
My awesome friends
came to cheer me on!

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:34.480
Who do you think they are?

00:10:34.480 --> 00:10:36.720
I don't know if you
know of them,

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.830
but they're the best
in all of Beybladi--

00:10:38.830 --> 00:10:39.720
Zeo!

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.890
Go to your room.

00:10:42.640 --> 00:10:44.280
Now, now, Master Zeo...

00:10:44.280 --> 00:10:47.040
Come on, Bill! I want to
talk with dad more!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.910
I told you to
go to your room.

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:50.550
But...

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:53.860
I'm not in the mood
to talk you to tonight.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:56.080
Bill, take Zeo to his room.

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:58.480
Dad...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:02.260
Come now, Master Zeo...

00:11:02.260 --> 00:11:04.730
Your father is tired...

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:10.740
Good night, dad...

00:11:23.810 --> 00:11:27.050
Let's do our best and
meet in the finals, Zeo!

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.390
Good luck!

00:11:28.390 --> 00:11:29.710
You can do it!

00:11:32.620 --> 00:11:34.270
You did it, Zeo!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:38.770
I'm strong now because we're
friends and we believe in each other.

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:41.530
I've never felt like
this before, Takao...

00:11:41.530 --> 00:11:42.910
Why are you here?

00:11:43.930 --> 00:11:46.680
I can't agree to this,
Doctor Zagart!

00:11:47.860 --> 00:11:53.700
You're the one who ordered us to steal
the tablet and extract the Sacred Beasts!

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:59.520
And you're the one who ordered us
to take BBA team's four Sacred Beasts!

00:12:00.880 --> 00:12:05.030
So why are you taking
us off that research?

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.990
I won't accept this!

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:08.460
I remember them!

00:12:14.410 --> 00:12:19.230
So those bad guys going
after Takao and his friends...

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:21.720
Was... My dad?

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:25.340
Dad...?

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:37.100
Takao's enemy...
Their boss...

00:12:37.420 --> 00:12:39.570
Is my... Is my...

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:41.590
My dad?!

00:12:42.640 --> 00:12:45.160
That... That can't...

00:12:45.530 --> 00:12:47.380
That can't be true!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:13:02.420
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade 2002"

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:08.220
Doctor Zagart!

00:13:08.690 --> 00:13:11.840
You're going to
regret losing us.

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:12.830
What?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:19.490
We've already detected the most powerful
of all Sacred Beasts dwelling within the tablet.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:23.320
If we had that, then the
BBA team's Sacred Beasts will be--

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.090
You're too late.

00:13:25.090 --> 00:13:29.700
I have already transferred
that Sacred Beast to a Bit Chip.

00:13:29.700 --> 00:13:30.960
You what?

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:33.810
I will take the
four Sacred Beasts.

00:13:34.490 --> 00:13:37.050
But what about the Blader?

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:39.190
You don't need to
worry about that!

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:39.990
The one to defeat Takao Kinomiya

00:13:39.990 --> 00:13:42.340
That's not true...

00:13:43.620 --> 00:13:45.280
and obtain the four Sacred Beasts will be me.

00:13:50.930 --> 00:13:51.940
Zeo.

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:54.620
Zeo!

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:05.110
Doctor, I have nothing
left to say to you.

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.400
Leave.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.120
Doctor Zagart...

00:14:10.800 --> 00:14:14.130
If you're going
to expel us...

00:14:14.480 --> 00:14:17.550
Why not expel
your own son, too?

00:14:17.550 --> 00:14:18.660
What?

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:21.840
He's made friends with
Takao Kinomiya's team.

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:25.890
And even fought against
our own Sacred Beasts.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.760
Is that okay with you?

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:32.420
As I thought.
You had no idea, Doctor Zagart.

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.170
Maybe I said too much?

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:40.120
We'll be watching the
rest from the sidelines.

00:14:41.010 --> 00:14:42.510
Good night.

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.400
Excuse us.

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:49.280
Zeo!

00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:54.690
Zeo, have you...

00:14:54.690 --> 00:14:56.080
Have you been...?!

00:14:58.930 --> 00:14:59.810
Zeo!

00:14:59.810 --> 00:15:01.140
Master!

00:15:02.240 --> 00:15:04.320
How long have you
been friends with them?

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:06.640
Why did you hide
this from me?!

00:15:06.640 --> 00:15:09.180
Why were you hiding
all that from me, dad?

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:12.080
Are you really trying to
take the four Sacred Beasts?

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:15.560
Are you really the one
who's been hurting them?

00:15:15.560 --> 00:15:16.550
Silence!

00:15:16.550 --> 00:15:17.810
Master!

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:18.920
Be quiet!

00:15:20.290 --> 00:15:21.760
Why were you...

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:25.870
Why are you trying to
steal the four Sacred Beasts?

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.560
I need them.

00:15:27.560 --> 00:15:31.220
I need the power of
the four Sacred Beasts!

00:15:31.220 --> 00:15:33.730
Why?! I just don't get it!

00:15:33.730 --> 00:15:34.660
Bill!

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:35.620
Yes, Master!

00:15:38.540 --> 00:15:43.330
This is a Bey with the ultimate
Sacred Beast from the tablet in it.

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:45.650
I call it Cerberus.

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:47.600
I'm giving this to you.

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:48.420
To me?

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:52.410
You will use Cerberus to defeat
Takao Kinomiya and his team,

00:15:52.410 --> 00:15:54.800
and take the four
Sacred Beasts from them!

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:57.200
Now take it, Zeo.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:00.360
No way! I can't do that!

00:16:00.360 --> 00:16:02.450
Takao's my friend!

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:05.190
I would never
ever do that!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:09.170
Why are you so obsessed with
the four Sacred Beasts' power?

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:12.530
Zeo, this is all for you!

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.040
For me?

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:16.130
What the heck is
that supposed to mean?

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:19.570
I have no idea what
you're going on about!

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:25.140
Zeo, you have an
important secret...

00:16:25.140 --> 00:16:27.580
That I've not once
told you about.

00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:29.880
Master, are you su--

00:16:29.880 --> 00:16:31.220
I don't care!

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:34.020
I knew this day
would come.

00:16:34.020 --> 00:16:39.220
Dad, what's this secret
you've never told me about?

00:16:52.400 --> 00:16:54.110
Zeo, you are...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.940
No, you're lying...

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.120
I can't believe that.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.770
You're lying!

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:11.180
Work hard, you guys!

00:17:11.180 --> 00:17:15.460
You've got to get in
perfect condition for the finals!

00:17:15.460 --> 00:17:16.500
Got it?

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:17.550
--Yeah.

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:19.800
Go...

00:17:19.800 --> 00:17:20.650
Shoot!

00:17:24.150 --> 00:17:28.020
What's got you looking
back and forth, Takao?

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:30.480
You aren't focused on
your practice at all!

00:17:30.480 --> 00:17:32.260
No, it's nothing!

00:17:32.530 --> 00:17:35.810
You're wondering why
Zeo isn't here, right?

00:17:35.810 --> 00:17:38.740
Yeah, don't you
think it's weird?

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:42.320
"Please let me practice
with you after the match!"

00:17:42.320 --> 00:17:47.080
Is what he said, and
he hasn't shown up yet!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:49.570
Maybe he got sick?

00:17:49.570 --> 00:17:52.100
Now that you
mention it, I'm worried!

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.970
Does anyone know
where Zeo lives?

00:17:54.860 --> 00:17:57.400
Why not ask the
gym he goes to?

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:58.930
Yeah!

00:17:59.500 --> 00:18:01.860
I knew you guys
were worried, too!

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.580
Focus on practicing!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:07.310
What? He quit the gym?

00:18:07.310 --> 00:18:11.010
But he just made it
past the qualifiers!

00:18:11.010 --> 00:18:13.060
That's what I thought!

00:18:13.060 --> 00:18:15.170
Do you know why he quit?

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:17.680
No, I don't.

00:18:17.680 --> 00:18:21.370
Some old man came
instead to say that he quit.

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:24.420
He said Zeo has more
important circumstances.

00:18:24.420 --> 00:18:25.790
Circumstances?

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:26.900
What did he mean?

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:28.450
Beats me!

00:18:33.480 --> 00:18:35.840
Master Zeo,
where are you going?

00:18:37.040 --> 00:18:39.330
Everything's changed.

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:44.600
After that night, my world's
been turned upside-down.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:51.520
I have nothing left
to believe in.

00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:52.870
Takao...

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:57.310
Those days I was obsessed with
Beyblade to get as good as you...

00:18:57.310 --> 00:19:00.160
It feels like it was
ages ago, now.

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:04.760
But there's no going
back to that world.

00:19:04.760 --> 00:19:08.610
Takao, what
should I do now?

00:19:09.120 --> 00:19:10.420
Takao...

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:19.140
What's gotten into Zeo?

00:19:19.140 --> 00:19:23.660
What's so baffling is that he just abandoned
his spot after making it past the qualifiers.

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:25.420
He was so happy
about it, too.

00:19:25.420 --> 00:19:30.170
But why hasn't he
even come to see us?

00:19:30.170 --> 00:19:32.970
Maybe there's
something bothering him.

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:35.210
That's my point!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:37.920
He didn't even
ask us for advice!

00:19:37.920 --> 00:19:40.010
He needs to be
more upfront with us.

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:42.810
What is it?

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:45.030
That's!

00:19:45.030 --> 00:19:47.650
Zeo!

00:19:51.010 --> 00:19:52.460
Zeo, wait!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:53.570
Zeo!

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:55.520
Hey!

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:56.980
Leave me alone!

00:19:57.890 --> 00:19:59.550
What's wrong, Zeo?

00:19:59.700 --> 00:20:01.570
Leave me alone!

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:04.520
Stay away! We're through!

00:20:04.520 --> 00:20:06.120
Stay away! Stay away!

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.580
From here on out, we're enemies.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:10.850
Forget everything
we've been through!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:12.630
How could we forget?

00:20:12.630 --> 00:20:15.150
What's gotten into you?

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:16.410
Kinomiya.

00:20:17.140 --> 00:20:19.850
Next time we meet,
I will defeat you!

00:20:22.640 --> 00:20:24.130
Wait, Zeo!

00:20:24.130 --> 00:20:25.170
Zeo!

00:20:29.330 --> 00:20:32.180
Zeo, what are you...

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:34.260
What happened?

00:20:38.960 --> 00:20:39.860
Zeo!

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.040
Zeo!

00:20:41.040 --> 00:20:43.630
Don't bother.
We can't stop him.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:44.830
Why?!

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.580
He's not coming back.

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:50.620
He doesn't see us
as friends anymore.

00:20:51.730 --> 00:20:54.110
That's what I
saw in his eyes.

00:20:54.930 --> 00:20:56.290
Why...

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.520
Why the heck?!

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.790
Zeo...

00:21:02.850 --> 00:21:04.320
Zeo!!

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:07.390
Master Zeo.

00:21:07.390 --> 00:21:08.560
Dad.

00:21:09.310 --> 00:21:10.820
Where is Cerberus?

00:21:10.820 --> 00:21:13.360
I'm here to take Cerberus!

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:14.910
Cerberus...

00:21:20.360 --> 00:21:22.540
You made the right
choice, coming back.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:27.010
Have you decided to take
their four Sacred Beasts?

00:23:00.590 --> 00:23:03.370
Zeo has suddenly
parted ways with us.

00:23:03.370 --> 00:23:05.930
Just what happened to him?

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:08.800
This isn't the time
for that, though.

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:11.470
New enemies approach Kai!

00:23:11.470 --> 00:23:13.270
And they're pretty
stylish, too!

00:23:13.270 --> 00:23:15.660
"Just like me
in my youth?"

00:23:15.660 --> 00:23:18.590
They look nothing
like you, Chairman!

00:23:18.590 --> 00:23:21.200
Don't miss the next episode!
